d shrews</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-loaded arsenal of over a dozen unique weapons and equipment - with a cartoon twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating consumable power-ups, capable of turning the tide of any battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable movement abilities and Metroidvania-inspired level traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original jazz soundtrack, featuring a big band orchestral ensemble </p></li></ul>","developers":["Fumi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/298ff2fc3f6a700d022b8d3ec58047f2b426be03/header.jpg?t=1761251343","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The name MOUSE and all copyright and other intellectual property in the game and name are owned by Fumi Games, all rights reserved. PlaySide and PlaySide Publishing are trademarks or registered trademarks of PlaySide Studios Limited. All other trademarks, copyrights and logos are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2416450/311147288/bf19ec052bed1d1ee559e4d1c665180d28593a18/1760658011/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761249458","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2416450/311147288/bf19ec052bed1d1ee559e4d1c665180d28593a18/1760658011/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761249458","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2416450/311147288/bf19ec052bed1d1ee559e4d1c665180d28593a18/1760658011/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761249458","id":257219003,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.st